{"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.060678321325092655,"w":0.10741874694824217,"x":0.081238723302793095,"h":0.016724752662397147,"c":1},{"y":0.10741777463232949,"c":1,"x":0.083044987598909617,"h":0.016128736913746389,"w":0.62456746419270825,"t":"Oliver Stanton was born and educated in the UK, and then went to Malaysia where he set"},{"t":"up a rubber-wood furniture business. He then built log houses in the mountains in Japan","h":0.01469559132260323,"x":0.083044984367002764,"w":0.61591695149739578,"y":0.12351294592613671,"c":1},{"y":0.13953488379629864,"t":"before moving to Hong Kong to set up a digital marketing business. After that he moved","h":0.015988371937820434,"x":0.08131487801424972,"w":0.62283737182617183,"c":1},{"h":0.016158234080373979,"c":1,"x":0.081314867203271038,"w":0.63494812011718749,"t":"back to the UK with his wife Saiphin, and together they opened a Thai café. He'll be telling","y":0.15535339374632773},{"y":0.1714485653484249,"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.63494812011718749,"t":"you about what he discovered during his travels around the world about business practices","x":0.081314867222980633},{"h":0.014338236409021099,"c":1,"t":"in different cultures.","y":0.18634135027471632,"w":0.14225803375244139,"x":0.082858755466421533},{"c":1,"w":0.6072664388020832,"t":"Francesca Heptonstall is a broadcaster and businesswoman who's known for her down-","x":0.083044981199235937,"y":0.20923722856529703,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"x":0.08127008561615795,"c":1,"w":0.58660868326822913,"h":0.018178033528418069,"y":0.22380872496673354,"t":"to-earth attitude. After winning a top job in a TV contest, she launched a number of"},{"x":0.082994544446637897,"w":0.60388285319010415,"c":1,"t":"online deal sites. Her main business interest is in technology, but she's also passionate","y":0.23967939766608537,"h":0.01872530911167325},{"w":0.59688583374023441,"y":0.25577326821525914,"h":0.017494751574527623,"t":"about helping people gain employment and organises an annual jobs fair, so she'll be","c":1,"x":0.081314868600035478},{"h":0.014707796885635283,"c":1,"t":"concentrating on this in her talk.","x":0.083044981728644718,"y":0.27325581371203245,"w":0.22664360046386717},{"t":"Salman Khan is the Chief Executive of QBF Enterprises, and has turned around this business","h":0.016095171448565426,"x":0.083044988151883867,"w":0.64013839721679688,"y":0.29496151151322447,"c":1},{"h":0.014705762736358485,"c":1,"t":"from a major publishing business to one of the UK's largest digital marketing service","x":0.081314890771539625,"y":0.31104651139289397,"w":0.5882352701822916},{"t":"providers. He'll be talking about the need for flexibility to cope with new directions in","y":0.32558139542170828,"c":1,"x":0.083044992112660906,"w":0.59515569051106765,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"c":1,"x":0.08111801879540205,"y":0.34128715859969605,"w":0.16478071848551434,"h":0.017705351427103611,"t":"today's business world."},{"c":1,"h":0.017441861023846261,"y":0.36337209274120741,"x":0.083044981206091634,"w":0.60726643880208331,"t":"Finally, Annie Craven is a consultant and coach who works with people to create lasting"},{"h":0.017504774831741177,"c":1,"x":0.082997296017704461,"y":0.37795203215438278,"w":0.60043126424153648,"t":"changes in their business and life. Her session will offer an interactive look at different"},{"y":0.39372946825191657,"x":0.082991563356761264,"t":"obstacles in people's own lives, not just in business. She also looks at how you can","h":0.01780223245800916,"w":0.57277104695638015,"c":1},{"y":0.41133720906527149,"w":0.58304499308268232,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"t":"overcome them, whether you're starting out in business or at the top of your game.","x":0.084775081261224683},{"h":0.012668761779913273,"w":0.097348047892252598,"t":"Now let me...","c":1,"x":0.08455009749436887,"y":0.43383572586898822},{"y":0.15552325590177851,"w":0.034602076212565169,"t":"Q17","h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"x":0.7474048441601534},{"t":"Q18","x":0.747404844802942,"y":0.24273255822735984,"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1},{"x":0.747404844802942,"t":"Q19","y":0.32703488380875523,"w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1,"h":0.01308139510051276},{"t":"Q20","x":0.747404844802942,"c":1,"h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.032871971130371103,"y":0.3822674419482901},{"c":1,"y":0.49086271293206496,"h":0.015367597362392793,"w":0.086698309580485036,"x":0.082948422979558553,"t":"PART 3"},{"t":"MIA:","y":0.5218023252498033,"h":0.011627907349230804,"x":0.083044983790447585,"w":0.027681659062703451,"c":1},{"x":0.083044982924405625,"c":1,"w":0.029411764144897462,"y":0.53779069782878142,"h":0.0087209298445513062,"t":"LEO:"},{"t":"MIA.","h":0.0087209298445511951,"y":0.5552325583044686,"c":1,"x":0.083044981947241817,"w":0.027681662241617846},{"c":1,"y":0.58575581408181798,"w":0.029411764144897462,"x":0.083044982928993039,"h":0.010174418263205198,"t":"LEO:"},{"w":0.029411764144897448,"c":1,"h":0.010174418263205087,"x":0.081314879092127382,"y":0.63372093037148614,"t":"MIA:"},{"t":"LEO:","w":0.029457591374715167,"c":1,"h":0.011709799209285054,"y":0.64821486764414371,"x":0.083022069624824779},{"x":0.083044981941474805,"y":0.66569767455753248,"h":0.010174418263205198,"c":1,"w":0.027681662241617833,"t":"MIA:"},{"t":"LEO:","x":0.08304498323896993,"y":0.68023255814068428,"h":0.010174418263205087,"w":0.029411764144897462,"c":1},{"w":0.027681662241617833,"h":0.010174418263205198,"c":1,"y":0.69767441874357916,"t":"MIA:","x":0.083044981941474805},{"t":"LEO:","c":1,"x":0.081314878477573058,"y":0.71220930209088862,"w":0.031141869227091473,"h":0.011627907349230693},{"h":0.010174418263205087,"c":1,"x":0.083044981941474805,"w":0.027681662241617833,"t":"MIA:","y":0.74418604665055588},{"t":"LEO:","w":0.031141869227091473,"h":0.011627907349230804,"x":0.081314878453826553,"y":0.77616279047723136,"c":1},{"w":0.029411764144897448,"c":1,"t":"MIA:","h":0.010174418263205087,"x":0.081314879092127382,"y":0.82412790711567219},{"w":0.032871971130371089,"h":0.011627907349230693,"c":1,"x":0.081314879477105889,"t":"LEO:","y":0.87063953463287824},{"x":0.083044981941474805,"w":0.027681662241617833,"y":0.90988372106916049,"h":0.010174418263205198,"c":1,"t":"MIA:"},{"h":0.010174418263205198,"c":1,"t":"LEO:","x":0.08304498323896993,"y":0.92441860465231207,"w":0.029411764144897462},{"h":0.013081395100512871,"x":0.084775086061194757,"c":1,"y":0.95930232566922025,"t":"114","w":0.031141869227091473},{"x":0.16608997296752592,"y":0.52029391196376473,"h":0.013296011196640922,"c":1,"t":"You know that joint presentation we've got to do this semester, Leo?","w":0.47923873901367187},{"y":0.53488372073212398,"t":"On houses of the future?","w":0.1747404861450195,"h":0.011652318475294798,"c":1,"x":0.1678200683479408},{"x":0.16782005957011922,"y":0.55073477970042939,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"w":0.5432526143391927,"t":"That's right. I'm a bit concerned - are we meant to come up with creative new"},{"t":"suggestions for these houses?","c":1,"x":0.16758241997314183,"w":0.21151339213053383,"y":0.56483887714029279,"h":0.017096641599256057},{"x":0.16608995960550146,"t":"I don't think so. It's more a matter of reporting and evaluating possible","h":0.014534884186538366,"c":1,"y":0.58284883697341883,"w":0.49826990763346357},{"c":1,"x":0.74740484480354274,"t":"Q21","y":0.58430232566467821,"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.013081395100512871},{"t":"developments. But we mustn't be too general, we've got to support our points","c":1,"y":0.59867039881587203,"x":0.16608996460431777,"w":0.5536332194010416,"h":0.014701694437805113},{"t":"by referring to specific cases. So that'll need a lot of work.","c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"y":0.61476557041857871,"x":0.16608996861829942,"w":0.40484428405761719},{"t":"I'm afraid so. When's it got to be done by?","y":0.63081395325081802,"w":0.29930796305338542,"h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.16608996303478818,"c":1},{"t":"In about 6 weeks, so that's not too much of a rush.","x":0.16608996854047878,"w":0.35467127482096361,"c":1,"y":0.64520643782623543,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"t":"Good. We'd better decide now what type of housing we're going to focus on.","c":1,"h":0.017494751574527734,"x":0.16608996716153152,"y":0.66130160940486915,"w":0.54671279907226555},{"x":0.1660899731809975,"w":0.42560551961263016,"t":"How about housing for different generations living together?","h":0.015988371937820545,"y":0.67732558133971377,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.34775085449218757,"x":0.16782007458424619,"y":0.69314205761957393,"t":"We could do. Or accommodation for one person?","h":0.014706779810996884},{"c":1,"t":"I think someone else is doing that. I was wondering about housing for the","x":0.16435986226164545,"y":0.70923722887057739,"w":0.51557093302408852,"h":0.016095171448565426},{"w":0.33910034179687498,"y":0.72529069755216524,"t":"elderly? That's likely to become more important.","h":0.016136874178225069,"x":0.16608996738010917,"c":1},{"w":0.61591695149739578,"c":1,"x":0.16608996706127452,"t":"Yeah that's true. But I think your suggestion about intergenerational living might Q22","y":0.74127906984252145,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1,"x":0.16435986732719793,"t":"be more interesting - let's go with that.","y":0.7571728481656339,"w":0.27854670206705728},{"x":0.16608996398942225,"t":"OK. Now I think the future demand is mainly going to be for accommodation","w":0.53806228637695319,"y":0.77325581402840704,"h":0.016107377011597479,"c":1},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.78924418581126887,"t":"in urban areas. So one way of meeting that demand might be to use existing","c":1,"x":0.16608997797988423,"w":0.53460205078125},{"y":0.80510846714576267,"h":0.013296011196641033,"x":0.16782006156933826,"c":1,"t":"commercial buildings and adapt them to form accommodation...","w":0.45155710856119791},{"h":0.014534882851794939,"c":1,"x":0.16782009660664224,"y":0.81976744205278473,"w":0.5294117228190105,"t":"... or come up with original ways of organising space so that people can live"},{"x":0.16608995824351269,"t":"in smaller homes. But I think the solution is to design multi-storey apartment","h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.83720930208967148,"w":0.53633219401041665,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395100512871,"x":0.747404844165242,"t":"Q23","y":0.8372093024112689,"w":0.034602076212565058,"c":1},{"x":0.16601265243410315,"c":1,"y":0.85300078945909463,"t":"blocks.","w":0.052057739893595384,"h":0.014928653575558282},{"w":0.22664360046386717,"t":"Building up rather than out, yes.","y":0.8691392581644366,"h":0.01469559132260323,"x":0.16608996429956535,"c":1},{"w":0.46539789835611989,"y":0.90552325588701266,"h":0.016100256821757197,"c":1,"t":"Let's think of some specific developments for houses of the future.","x":0.16608997807254955},{"y":0.92151162797990305,"x":0.1660899532228865,"w":0.55017303466796874,"h":0.015988371937820434,"t":"OK. How about increased use of roof space on high-rise buildings for gardens.","c":1}],"h":2857,"w":2400}